{#
  BeMart admin Tag list — EC-CUBE goTagList (タグ管理).

  PORT of EC-CUBE 4.3 admin-theme `Product/tag.twig`
  (src/Eccube/Resource/template/admin/Product/tag.twig).

  Product section, LIST + inline-FORM page. It extends the admin frame
  (`admin-base.html.twig`, the port of EC-CUBE's admin
  `default_frame.twig`), not the storefront `base.html.twig`. The markup
  skeleton + `c-*` / `ec-*` / Bootstrap classes are kept verbatim from
  EC-CUBE; only the dynamic bindings are rebound to the TagList resource
  body (src/Resource/Page/Admin/Tag/TagList.php — body carries `tags`
  (a list of {tagId, tagName}), `count` and an AdminTagForm exposed as
  `form`).

  EC-CUBE-ism rebinding (see var/templates/README.md, "Admin pages"):
   - `{{ 'key'|trans }}`  -> the ja literal from messages.ja.yaml.
   - `url(route, params)` -> deterministic `/{route}?{query}`
     (`BeMartTwigExtension`).
   - `form_widget(form.name)` -> `form.input('name')` — the real
     AdminTagForm inline-create input (Ray.WebFormModule).
   - `form_widget(form._token)` -> EC-CUBE per-request CSRF widget. The
     hidden `_token` input is kept (structure) with an empty value;
     EC-CUBE-runtime only — enumerated as residual.
   - `{% for Tag in Tags %}` -> the resource body's `tags` list.
   - `Tag.id` / `Tag.name` -> the BeMart projection keys `tagId` /
     `tagName`. `Tag.sortNo` -> dtb_tag has the column but TagEntity
     does NOT project it (the storage tracks sort_no internally — see
     FakeTagStorage); the `data-sort-no` attribute renders empty.
     FLAGGED for enrichment follow-up.
   - per-row `forms[Tag.id]` inline-EDIT form -> ALPS exposes neither
     `doUpdateTag` nor `goTag` (only DELETE — see the Tag resource
     docblock), so the resource carries no per-row edit form. The
     `mode-edit` collapse panel keeps EC-CUBE's structure but renders a
     plain `<input>` repopulated from the row; it sits inside a `d-none`
     collapse and has no BeMart submit target. Enumerated as residual.
   - the entity-extension `auto_render` `{% for %}` loop ->
     EC-CUBE entity-extension runtime; dropped (EC-CUBE-runtime only).
   - `csrf_token_for_anchor()` on the delete `<a>` -> EC-CUBE per-request
     CSRF widget. OMITTED exactly as the storefront ports omit it.
#}
{% extends 'admin-base.html.twig' %}

{% set route = 'admin_product_tag' %}
{% set title = 'タグ管理' %}
{% set sub_title = '商品管理' %}

{% block stylesheet %}
    <style>
        .list-group-item:hover {
            z-index: inherit;
        }
    </style>
{% endblock stylesheet %}
{% block javascript %}
    <script>
        $(function() {
            // 初期表示時のsort noを保持.
            var oldSortNos = [];
            $('.sortable-item').each(function() {
                oldSortNos.push(this.dataset.sortNo);
            });
            oldSortNos.sort(function(a, b) {
                return a - b;
            }).reverse();
            // 並び替え後にsort noを更新
            var updateSortNo = function() {
                var newSortNos = {};
                var i = 0;
                $('.sortable-item').each(function() {
                    newSortNos[this.dataset.id] = oldSortNos[i];
                    i++;
                });
                $.ajax({
                    url: '{{ url('admin_product_tag_sort_no_move') }}',
                    type: 'POST',
                    data: newSortNos
                }).always(function() {
                    $(".modal-backdrop").remove();
                });
            };
            // 最初と最後の↑↓を再描画
            var redrawDisableAllows = function() {
                var items = $('.sortable-item');
                items.find('a').removeClass('disabled');
                items.first().find('a.action-up').addClass('disabled');
                items.last().find('a.action-down').addClass('disabled');
            };
            // オーバレイ後, 表示順の更新を行う
            var moveSortNo = function() {
                $('body').append($('<div class="modal-backdrop show"></div>'));
                updateSortNo();
                redrawDisableAllows();
            };
            // Drag and Drop
            $('.sortable-container').sortable({
                items: '> .sortable-item',
                cursor: 'move',
                update: function(e, ui) {
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });
            // Up
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'a.action-up', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents("li");
                if (current.prev().hasClass('sortable-item')) {
                    current.prev().before(current);
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });
            // Down
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'a.action-down', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents("li");
                if (current.next().hasClass('sortable-item')) {
                    current.next().after(current);
                    moveSortNo();
                }
            });

            // 編集
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'a.action-edit', function(e) {
                e.preventDefault();
                var current = $(this).parents("li");
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });

            // 編集キャンセル
            $('.sortable-item').on('click', 'button.action-edit-cancel', function(e) {
                location.href = '{{ url('admin_product_tag') }}';
            });
            // 編集時, エラーがあれば入力欄を表示.
            $('.sortable-item').find('.is-invalid').each(function(e) {
                var current = $(this).parents("li");
                current.find('.mode-view').addClass('d-none');
                current.find('.mode-edit').removeClass('d-none');
            });

            // 削除モーダルのhrefとmessageの変更
            $('#DeleteModal').on('shown.bs.modal', function(event) {
                var target = $(event.relatedTarget);
                // hrefの変更
                $(this).find('[data-post-action="delete"]').attr('href', target.data('url'));

                // messageの変更
                $(this).find('p.modal-message').text(target.data('message'));
            });
        });
    </script>
{% endblock %}

{% block main %}
    <div class="c-contentsArea__cols">
        <div class="c-contentsArea__primaryCol">
            <div class="c-primaryCol">
                <div class="card rounded border-0 mb-4">
                    <div class="card-body p-0">
                        <div class="card rounded border-0">
                            <ul class="list-group list-group-flush sortable-container">
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <form role="form" class="row" method="post" action="{{ url('admin_product_tag') }}">
                                        <input type="hidden" id="admin_tag__token" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                                        <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                            {{ form.input('name')|raw }}
                                        </div>

                                        <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-regular" type="submit">
                                                新規作成
                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                  </form>
                                </li>
                                <li class="list-group-item">
                                    <div class="row">
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-auto"><strong>ID</strong></div>
                                        <div class="col-1"><strong>タグ</strong></div>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                {% for Tag in tags %}
                                    <li id="ex-tag-{{ Tag.tagId }}" class="list-group-item sortable-item" data-id="{{ Tag.tagId }}"
                                        data-sort-no="">
                                        <div class="row justify-content-around mode-view">
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center"><i class="fa fa-bars text-ec-gray"></i></div>
                                            <div class="col-auto d-flex align-items-center">{{ Tag.tagId }}</div>
                                            <div class="col d-flex align-items-center"><a>{{ Tag.tagName }}</a>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto text-end">
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-up{% if loop.first %} disabled{% endif %}" href="#" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="上へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-up fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-down{% if loop.last %} disabled{% endif %}" href="#" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="下へ">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-arrow-down fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon me-2 action-edit" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="top" title="編集">
                                                    <i class="fa fa-pencil fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                </a>
                                                <div class="d-inline-block me-2" data-bs-toggle="tooltip"
                                                     data-bs-placement="top" title="削除">
                                                    <a class="btn btn-ec-actionIcon" data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#DeleteModal"
                                                       data-url="{{ url('admin_product_tag_delete', {'id' : Tag.tagId}) }}"
                                                       data-message="この操作はあとから取り消すことができません。「{{ Tag.tagName }}」を削除してよろしいですか？">
                                                        <i class="fa fa-close fa-lg text-secondary"></i>
                                                    </a>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <form class="row d-none mode-edit" method="post" action="{{ url('admin_product_tag') }}">
                                            <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken|default('') }}">
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="name" value="{{ Tag.tagName }}" data-origin-value="{{ Tag.tagName }}">
                                            </div>

                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-conversion" type="submit">決定</button>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-auto align-items-center">
                                                <button class="btn btn-ec-sub action-edit-cancel" type="button">キャンセル</button>
                                            </div>
                                        </form>
                                    </li>
                                {% endfor %}
                            </ul>
                            <!-- 削除モーダル -->
                            <div class="modal fade" id="DeleteModal" tabindex="-1" role="dialog"
                                 aria-labelledby="DeleteModal" aria-hidden="true">
                                <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
                                    <div class="modal-content">
                                        <div class="modal-header">
                                            <h5 class="modal-title fw-bold">
                                                削除します
                                            </h5>
                                            <button class="btn-close" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">

                                            </button>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-body text-start">
                                            <p class="text-start modal-message"><!-- jsでメッセージを挿入 --></p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="modal-footer">
                                            <button class="btn btn-ec-sub" type="button" data-bs-dismiss="modal">
                                                キャンセル
                                            </button>
                                            <a class="btn btn-ec-delete" href="#"
                                               data-confirm="false">
                                                削除
                                            </a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p>項目の順番はドラッグ＆ドロップでも変更可能です。</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

{% endblock %}
